    "detailed_description": "Sengoku era ... Nobunaga Oda, Shingen Takeda, Kenshin Uesugi ... This era is a group of heroes.<br />\r\nYou will be one of this era and will play as a daimyo or a vassal.<br />\r\nIn this game, not only the enemy and the ally, you do not know &quot;whether the other party trusts you&quot; or &quot;whether the other party is a trustworthy person&quot;.<br />\r\nYou need to make your own judgment and keep up with each other.<br />\r\nStrategy, tactics, domestic affairs, diplomacy, plots, tactics ... Let's aim for success and unification of the Sengoku by using everything that can be possessed.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTurn-based Sengoku simulation game!<br />\r\nIn addition to over 200 unique warlords, warlords are automatically generated and will not be exhausted.<br />\r\nYou can also create and play new warlords",
